## Scope of Adaptation
This skill adapts hypothesis-driven root cause analysis (RCA) and disciplined debugging methodology from `obra/superpowers` for use within the Market Management System (MMS) Flutter, Drift SQLite, and Windows Service architecture. It focuses on SQLite WAL diagnostics, lock troubleshooting, outbox stall resolution, and monetary rounding drift detection.

